            "review_text": "SarahH70\nManchester, United Kingdom294 contributions\n0\nNice Bar with Great Pizza!\nJan 2026 • Friends\nCentral location, this bar is also a pod hotel on a busy back street in Old Hanoi. We were heading to a bar nearby to watch the football then noticed in passing it was being shown here but a few minutes ahead of the other bar. Staff were friendly and quick to serve. We ordered their pizzas which are cooked across the street in a wood fired oven and they were very good and also a reasonable price. After the football the bar had a DJ and it did get quite busy with people coming in to dance. Overall we had a great meal, quick service and good value for money.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 13, 2026",
