            "review_text": "Private E\n11 contributions\n0\nGreat Middle Eastern Food. Cool Place.\nFeb 2024 • Solo\nFactory 47 has a nice, laid back ambience that is trendy, good music, and also has Middle Eastern food under the name of 'Al Habibi'. I was so pleased to find Middle Eastern food in Hanoi! I was first there in January 2024 and again in Feb/March. The food was good, so I went there very often. The owners were also very pleasant and welcoming. I hope to go back to Hanoi in 2025 and will definitely go to Factory 47/Al Habibi again.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nI'm hoping that my rating is saying 'Very good' because the site doesn't say what it is.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 13, 2025",
